# Pairs with BulkHintBound. A replay step that advances the read position
# without applying the record.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundReplaySkipsRecord
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the appended leaf advances its read position past a record without applying it
PERTURBS: Replay

--- FIND
    /\ heldN' = heldN \cup {rpN + 1}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the record is not applied.
    /\ heldN' = heldN
--- END
